{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23738","headline":"送陕州王司马建赴任 · 白居易","name":"送陕州王司马建赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陕州司马去何如，养静资贫两有余。\n公事闲忙同少尹，料钱多少敌尚书。\n秪携美酒爲行伴，唯作新诗趂下车。\n自有铁牛无咏者，料君投刃必应虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}